graph TD
    A([💬 Start: Log In to
Support Dashboard]) --> B[(ERP DB: Load Live Queue:
Tickets & Chat Requests)]
    B --> C[View Prioritized Queue:
Peak Load Sorted by Wait Time]
    C --> D{Incoming
Request Type}
    D -- Live Chat --> E[Accept Chat Session
Greet Student]
    D -- Support Ticket --> F[Open Ticket
Review Student Issue Description]
    D -- Phone Escalation --> G[Accept Call & Log
New Ticket in ERP]
    E --> H[Diagnose Issue
via Chat Triage]
    F --> I[Diagnose Issue
from Ticket Description]
    G --> I
    H --> J{Issue
Category}
    I --> J
    J -- Portal Login / Access --> K[(ERP DB: Verify Account
Status & Reset if Needed)]
    K --> L[Guide Student Through
Access Recovery Steps]
    J -- Registration Error --> M[(ERP DB: Pull Student
Registration Record & Errors)]
    M --> N{Error
Resolvable by Tech?}
    N -- Yes --> O[Apply Fix: Remove
Hold, Fix Enrollment, Correct Data]
    O --> P[(ERP DB: Log Action
& Update Record)]
    N -- No: Requires Higher Auth --> Q[Escalate Ticket to
Registrar or Admin]
    Q --> R[(ERP DB: Update Ticket
Status to Escalated)]
    J -- Technical / System Bug --> S[Document Bug Report
with Screenshots & Steps]
    S --> T[(ERP DB: Create Bug Ticket
Route to Dev / IT Team)]
    L --> U[Confirm Resolution
with Student]
    P --> U
    R --> V[Notify Student:
Ticket Escalated — Expected SLA]
    T --> W[Notify Student:
Bug Logged — Workaround if Available]
    U --> X{Student
Satisfied?}
    X -- Yes --> Y[(ERP DB: Close Ticket
Log Resolution Notes)]
    X -- No --> H
    V --> Z([✅ End: Ticket Escalated])
    W --> Z
    Y --> AA([✅ End: Issue Resolved & Closed])